# Generated by forge from typescript/nextjs/no-redirect-in-try (mode: forbid).
id: typescript/nextjs/no-redirect-in-try
language: Tsx
severity: error
message: "forge:typescript/nextjs/no-redirect-in-try redirect(), permanentRedirect(), notFound(), forbidden() and unauthorized() from next/navigation are not called in a try block whose catch does not call unstable_rethrow(error): they throw, and the catch would swallow the navigation. Call them after the try."
