===== .forge/ast-grep/rules/typescript/no-dynamic-regexp.yml
# Generated by forge from typescript/no-dynamic-regexp (mode: advise).
id: typescript/no-dynamic-regexp
language: Tsx
severity: warning
message: "forge:typescript/no-dynamic-regexp A RegExp built from a non-literal pattern (new RegExp(input), RegExp(`^${p}`)) escapes it with RegExp.escape() (ES2025, Node 24) unless the text is meant as a pattern: unescaped input changes what matches and can backtrack for ever."
rule:
