===== .forge/ast-grep/rules/typescript/prisma/no-query-in-loop.yml
# Generated by forge from typescript/prisma/no-query-in-loop (mode: advise).
id: typescript/prisma/no-query-in-loop
language: Tsx
severity: warning
message: forge:typescript/prisma/no-query-in-loop A Prisma query whose result type is PrismaPromise (findMany, count, aggregate, groupBy, the *Many methods) is not awaited inside a loop body (for, for…of, for…in, while, do) or an async .map / .forEach / .flatMap callback; one query per item is N round trips. Fetch the rows in one query (include, in, a relation filter) or batch them.
rule:
