message: forge:typescript/prisma/no-raw-interpolation No Prisma.raw() built from a template with ${} or a concatenation, directly or through a variable declared from one in the same function or module; raw() inserts its text unescaped. Use the tagged $queryRaw`...` / Prisma.sql`...` forms, which bind values.
